    {
      "oldText": "Agave tells them apart by inspecting the path.",
      "newText": "Agave can also download models directly from Hugging Face Hub using the `pull` subcommand, which selects the best file(s) based on quantization preference:

```bash
agave pull Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.6B-GGUF
agave pull Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.6B-GGUF --quant Q4_K_M
agave pull Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.6B-GGUF --list    # list available files without downloading
```

See [`src/pull.zig`](../../src/pull.zig) for the download implementation.

Agave tells them apart by inspecting the path."
    }
